  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following figure:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM00012619_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 176px;\" /><br />We assumed the value of sides in terms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, which satisfies&nbsp;our given condition.</p><p>Now applying cosine rule,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Length of the sides will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn></math>.</p>",
